  26:     - Remove every marker pixel by recoloring it to the background.
  27:     - For each 4-connected neutral mask component, find marker colors touching it by edge adjacency.
  28:     - If a component touches one marker color, recolor the whole neutral component to that marker color.
  29:     - If a component touches no marker color, leave it neutral.
